batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5079520-1847286114033901","game_id":"steam-5079520","kind":"announcement","title":"Can you clear THE ROAD?","summary":"Next Fest is halfway through, and THE ROAD is the demo's main mode.Five cases against invasive species, back to back, with one line of creatures. A knocked-out creature is gone for the rest of the road, and one loss ends it.Every star you win pays ratings. Spend them in THE COMPENDIUM to unlock new creatures for your next road. Clear all five cases and you pick one of three locked creatures to keep.The 14 SPECIAL REPORT creatures can't be bought. Each one has its own challenge on the road.If you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T18:57:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033901","verified_at":"2026-10-22T23:45:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5079520-1846651706692439","game_id":"steam-5079520","kind":"announcement","title":"The Cup is in Steam Next Fest · live today at 4:30 PM Pacific","summary":"The demo is in Steam Next Fest this week, October 19 to 26. It plays offline: THE ROAD (five cases against invasive species, back to back), the tutorial and matches against the House.Today at 4:30 PM Pacific, Tkayy, the solo developer behind The Cup, plays a run of THE ROAD live, right here on the store page, and on Twitch and YouTube. Come ask questions in chat.New here? Start with the tutorial. It's short, and the booth explains the dice as you go.Tell us what broke, what confused you, and whi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:27:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692439","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5079520-1846651706686186","game_id":"steam-5079520","kind":"announcement","title":"The Cup: Creature Card Battler - playing THE ROAD in the demo!","summary":"Solo developer behind The Cup, is playing the demo live: a few runs of THE ROAD, five cases against invasive species with one line of creatures. The demo is in Steam Next Fest, October 19 to 26. If you like what you see, wishlist The Cup!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T05:52:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686186","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5079520-1846651706685308","game_id":"steam-5079520","kind":"announcement","title":"0.0.9: drag your drafts, a new case 02, and THE ROAD's unlocks","summary":"0.0.9 is a polish pass on THE ROAD, plus two card changes. It also carries 0.0.8's notes, below, which never went up on their own. THE ROAD- Case 02 plays differently. Good Intentions no longer heals one of the House's creatures each turn. Now the House may swap two of its adjacent creatures, and the feed tells you when it does. It's an easier case than it was.- In that case, the House puts Copal on the creature you could actually knock out, not on its strongest.- The first time you open a creat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T18:36:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685308","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5079520-1846651706675912","game_id":"steam-5079520","kind":"update","title":"THE ROAD is now a run (Update 0.0.7)","summary":"THE ROAD now plays as one run Five cases against invasive species, back to back, with one line of creatures.Draft three creatures from six and a kit card, then after every win take one of three spoils: a new creature for the bench, a card for the deck, or an infusion. Once a run, the Big Brown Break offers a boon. A creature knocked out is gone for the rest of the road, and a loss ends it.Sasquatch and Loup-Garou are painted now! Both done by Ondřej Tichý, Loup-Garou changes every turn: CALM swi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T23:55:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675912","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5079520-1846018067936755","game_id":"steam-5079520","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is out!","summary":"The Cup's demo is out! The Download Demo button is on the store page -> What's in it: THE ROAD: five bouts against invasive species, fifteen stars to earn. It's only in the demo for now. The tutorial: one match, called by the booth, from your first card to your first natural twelve. The Arena: matches against the House, dealt or drafted, as many as you want. Your contestant file: your record, your tapes, and a shelf of mugs to earn. It's offline, start to finish. A match runs three to six minute","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T17:00:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936755","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5079520-1845383656389664","game_id":"steam-5079520","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo trailer is here. Free demo October 10.","summary":"The Cup is a free 1v1 creature card battler, and it launches on Steam on Tuesday, November 10! Every contestant is a mutated version of a real North American animal, entered under its true natural history. Field a survivor and a line of three, play cards, roll the dice printed on them, and hold the center. Two booth hosts call every swing of an alien broadcast. At launch: Steam multiplayer: live 1v1 against real people. THE ROAD, draft, and House matches against the AI. More bouts and more cards","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T17:54:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656389664","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5079520":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:36:47Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T22:36:46Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5079520":"2026-10-25T22:36:47Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5079520":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:36:46Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:36:46Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5114480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:36:47Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:36:47Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5079520","app_id":5079520,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:24Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"0eb5c576b55b0d7ee4f2511c9876c57b5305d4c5e89303ae5a3b42cabf318090","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A free 1v1 creature card battler with roguelike runs. Draft a line of real North American animals, plus a few cryptids. Play a card, make your swing, and watch the die TV decide how hard it lands while the booth calls every roll.","publishers":[{"name":"Self-published"}],"developers":[{"name":"Tkayy"}]},"r